{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>שומר מצוה</b> — that he not abandon it. <b>שומר נפשו</b> — from death." "<b>ובוזה דרכיו</b> — and those proper to Him." "<b>ימות</b> — by the hand of Heaven, before his time. It is written יומת — a bet din may put him to death, if it becomes known that he despised the way of the commandments openly."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {2 "Reading שב\"ד as שבית דין (bet din)."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:39.991923778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}